From: GIMP Modernization Team <team@gimp.org>
Subject: [PATCH 0003/0004] Top 10 High-Return Features: Non-Destructive Layers, AI & Smart PSD Engine

Integrates non-destructive Adjustment Layers over GEGL, real-time Layer Styles FX
(Drop Shadow, Stroke, Outer Glow, Bevel & Emboss), Smart Objects & Linked Assets,
local offline AI plugins (SAM 2, RMBG-1.4, SDXL Inpainting), Smart PSD resource blocks,
OpenColorIO v2 ACES color management, and dynamic Workspace Switcher.
---
